      "en": "The angel of the Lord said to Manoah, “If I stay,[NOTE:1] I will not eat your food. But if you want to make a burnt sacrifice to the Lord, you should offer it.” (He said this because Manoah did not know that he was the angel of the Lord.)[NOTE:2]",
